<title>CANADA: Inco Ltd Q1 shr profit falls.</title>
<headline>Inco Ltd Q1 shr profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>three months ended March 31</p>
<p>			     1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.27		  US$0.49</p>
<p> Net			 58,000		   63,000</p>
<p> Revs		     795,000		  840,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 166,725		  116,246 </p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 first quarter results included an after-tax gain of US$36 million, or US$0.22 per share, from sale of interest in Doncasters PLC. Q1 results also reflect issuance of 50.3 million shares for acquisition of Diamond Fields Resources Inc. ((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
